# The rebalance run again, continued gently. The first attempt restarted at the
# full peak learning rate - ten times the rate the published run finished at -
# and came out no better than where it began (219 against 227 of 300 paired
# positions). This one runs the action expert at a tenth of its rate - the only rate
# LeRobot's MolmoAct2 reads in LoRA mode, see docs/EXPERIMENTS.md 6 - and the data is
# the same, so the difference is the schedule.
source training/settings.rebalance.env
OUTPUT_DIR=outputs/molmoact2_mc_v3
LR_SCALE=0.1
